                                "sense_id": "e63efe8d-9f6b-3e17-bdea-2a3796dbede9",
                                "text": "Relistings are treated as new listings and will be allocated through the allocation process pursuant to Exchange Rule 103B, Section Ill."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60a5bdfa-82af-4154-923b-7fe4f5c94a59",
                                "sense_id": "e63efe8d-9f6b-3e17-bdea-2a3796dbede9",
                                "text": "Relistings are your indicator that a deal might be in the works."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5f8f33a-6dc2-457b-b82e-b340e4cbd4f4",
                                "sense_id": "e63efe8d-9f6b-3e17-bdea-2a3796dbede9",
                                "text": "For simplicity, we have omitted the mean correlations below the diagonal since those are simply relistings of mean correlations shown above the diagonals."
